{"title":"9 ft Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003cp\u003eIncorporating a 9 Foot Artificial Christmas Tree into your holiday decor\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWelcome to the enchanting world of our 9-foot artificial Christmas trees collection at King of Christmas! Each tree is meticulously handmade, crafted with care to bring the magic of the season into your home. Setting up and taking down your tree has never been easier with hinged sections, and we provide protective gloves to make the process a breeze.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e9 ft Artificial Christmas Tree Colors \u0026amp; Styles\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoose from a palette of festive colors, including the traditional rich green, cool green, serene blue-green, or the timeless flocked green. Whether you prefer the warm glow of pre-lit trees or the opportunity to add your own lights, we have options to suit every preference. Our collection caters to various body styles made with classic or realistic needle tips, or a blend of both, and ranges from full-bodied to slim and pencil, ensuring the perfect fit for your space.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur 9 ft Artificial Christmas Tree Features\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo add to the convenience, each tree comes with a storage bag to keep it safe and sound during the off-season, and a sturdy metal tree stand for a secure and stylish display. No matter your style or space, our 9-foot artificial Christmas trees offer a diverse range of options, allowing you to create the holiday centerpiece that perfectly captures the spirit of the season. Make this Christmas truly magical with King of Christmas!\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"9-foot-queen-flock-tree-led","title":"9' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 1100 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642898804800,"sku":"QF-T9-L","price":999.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlock_570c2957-702c-4393-95f3-99e0455c528e.jpg?v=1722012619"},{"product_id":"9-foot-king-flock-slim-tree-unlit","title":"9' King Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642902081600,"sku":"KFS-T9-U","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-4_f294daff-b7c9-4c98-a20e-3d3c08a07b0b.jpg?v=1718159089"},{"product_id":"9-foot-king-flock-slim-tree-led","title":"9' King Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 900 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":28642902212672,"sku":"KFS-T9-L","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlockSlim_75ca9054-4438-4cb7-8f01-f0b3c6b36b67.jpg?v=1714673452"},{"product_id":"9-foot-king-flock-tree-unlit","title":"9' King Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642905423936,"sku":"KF-T9-U","price":499.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/king-flock-artificial-christmas-tree_417eaa9e-64d5-420b-9f9e-0532d1464aef.jpg?v=1718159080"},{"product_id":"9-foot-king-flock-tree-led","title":"9' King Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 1100 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642905849920,"sku":"KF-T9-L","price":899.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlock_fa57f85a-e2a6-4c97-890c-65a451ccd556.jpg?v=1714673362"},{"product_id":"9-foot-king-noble-fir-tree-unlit","title":"9' King Noble Fir Artific